# Bulk render masters. These are inputs to tools/encode-approach.mjs and
# tools/encode-falling-blocks.mjs, the site serves none of them, and every output
# they produce is committed under assets/. They came to 604 MB — more than eight
# times the rest of the repository put together — so they live on my machine
# and are restored to these paths only when something needs re-encoding.
#
# Everything else that used to sit under project/ is now tracked, in
# source-material/. See source-material/README.md.
/project/
/Falling Blocks/
/desk render preview/

# The assembled WordPress plugin (node tools/build-wp-plugin.mjs --assemble dist) and the
# local WordPress the verification harness installs. Both are rebuilt from the repository.
/dist/
/.wp-verify/
